{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261023%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 0930　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>涉向鄧家彪陳沛良辦事處淋潑紅油　66歲男被控刑毀｜新案提堂</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭念慈<br/>會計師涉麼士公園更衣室偷拍男子｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸粉嶺法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官溫紹明<br/>落馬洲古洞路旅遊巴撞斃女途人　司機被控危駕致死｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>612基金信託人提上訴案　兩人涉法庭範圍內拍攝｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.336873+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":382,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:50:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:37:53.777792+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635285+00:00","content_hash":"5785146214632dd98e82f215cbc06e1c121284d140802992719501206e33abf8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}